Sources and attribution

This repository includes original contributions and material adapted from other
projects. Third-party material retains its applicable license and copyright
notices. This NOTICE is informational and does not modify those licenses.

The review catalogue draws on tenstorrent/tt-buddy, tenstorrent/tt_ops_code_gen,
tenstorrent/tt-metal, and the maintainer-local tt-metal-pr-review skill.
SOURCES.md records the upstream paths, revisions, contributors, and adaptations.

The tt-model-bringup plugin imports skills, prompts, orchestration, and readiness
support from tt-metal. Its SYNC.md and sync-source.json record the source revision,
imported paths, and package adaptations.

The tt-autodebug plugin imports AutoDebug and AutoTriage prompts from a
maintainer-local autodebug repository. Its SYNC.md and sync-source.json record the
source revision and imported files.

